"entity": {
"name": "Podravka d.d.",
"description": "Podravka dd engages in the production and distribution of food products and non-alcoholic beverages. It operates through the following segments: Culinary; Baby Food, Sweets and Snacks; Podravka Food; Zito and Lagris; Meat Products, Meat Solutions, and Savory Spreads; Fish; Pharmaceutical; and Other. The Culinary segment offers seasonings, soups, ready-to-cook meals and bouillons, food mixes, and monospices. The Podravka Food segment includes condiments, tomato, sauces, fruit, vegetables, and flour. The Zito and Lagris segment provides core food, bakery and mill products, tea, confectionery, and cereals for adults. The Meat Products, Meat Solutions, and Savory Spreads segment supplies canned meat, sausages, food solution, and other meat. The Fish segment comprises fish products. The Pharmaceutical segment consists of ethical drugs, nonprescription program, nutraceuticals, and trade goods and services. The Other segment refers to the following product groups: merchandise and food services. The company was founded by Marijan Wolf and Matija Wolf in 1934 and is headquartered in Koprivnica, Croatia.",
"rbics_econ": "Consumer Non-Cyclicals",
